ctor v2 = new Vector(points[pivot], points[idx2]);\n                        double angle = Math.acos(v1.dot(v2) / (v1.magnitude() * v2.magnitude()));\n                        if (angle < Math.PI / 2 - EPSILON) {\n                            allAnglesLarge = false;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                if (allAnglesLarge) {\n                    goodIndices.add(pivot + 1);\n                }\n            }\n\n            System.out.println(goodIndices.size());\n            goodIndices.forEach(System.out::println);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class Vector {\n        private final int[] data;\n\n        Vector(int[] start, int[] end) {\n            data = new int[5];\n            for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n                data[i] = end[i] - start[i];\n            }\n        }\n\n        double magnitude() {\n            double sum = 0.0;\n            for (int val : data) {\n                sum += (long) val * val;\n            }\n            return Math.sqrt(sum);\n        }\n\n        int dot(Vector other) {\n            int total = 0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n                total += data[i] * other.data[i];\n            }\n            return total;\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <iomanip>\n\nclass Vector {\nprivate:\n    std::vector<int> data;\n\npublic:\n    Vector(const std::vector<int>& start, const std::vector<int>& end) {\n        data.resize(5);\n        for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n            data[i] = end[i] - start[i];\n        }\n    }\n\n    double magnitude() const {\n        double sum = 0.0;\n        for (int val : data) {\n            sum += static_cast<long long>(val) * val;\n        }\n        return std::sqrt(sum);\n    }\n\n    int dot(const Vector& other)